Wow.  I made it again ... This wasn't as easy as the wizard in some
ways; I had gotten too used to using spells for everything. But once
again I ended up using Magicbane (which came from a bones pile) almost
from Gehennom onward, sometimes twoweaponing with some elven daggers.
And with a robe and a +4 helm of brilliance, I ended up using some
spells quite a bit anyway.  Remove curse came in handy in the midgame,
and charm monster at the end.

My next try is also going to be a valk. I want to see if I can learn to
do it without such rich bones to draw on.

Rachel, neutral female human Valkyrie






